{
  "$schema": "./schema/achievement.schema.json",
  "design_notes": [
    "The twelve examples of design section 13.5, in list order. The section is headed \"Achievements (examples)\", so the list is not final.",
    "scope is career for the two achievements counted across missions (Codex Collector, Patch Archivist) and mission for the rest; the design does not state it. Metric names are proposals for Core."
  ],
  "achievements": [
    {
      "id": "escape_velocity",
      "name_key": "achievement.escape_velocity.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.escape_velocity.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "contract_completed",
          "op": "is_true"
        }
      ],
      "contracts": [
        "C6",
        "C7"
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "\"A lunar or Mars contract\" is C6 Lunar Loop or C7 Red Landing: completing either one earns it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "penny_pincher",
      "name_key": "achievement.penny_pincher.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.penny_pincher.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "budget_remaining_fraction",
          "op": "gte",
          "value": 0.3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "on_the_dot",
      "name_key": "achievement.on_the_dot.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.on_the_dot.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "launched_at_optimal_second",
          "op": "is_true"
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "Launching at the optimal second is the Gold reward of MG-07 Go/No-Go Poll."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hoverslam_hero",
      "name_key": "achievement.hoverslam_hero.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.hoverslam_hero.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "booster_landed",
          "op": "is_true"
        },
        {
          "metric": "booster_touchdown_speed_m_s",
          "op": "lt",
          "value": 1
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "MG-24 Hoverslam counts a touchdown below 2 m/s as a success; this achievement asks for below 1 m/s."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "all_hands",
      "name_key": "achievement.all_hands.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.all_hands.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "all_minigames_gold",
          "op": "is_true"
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "Same condition as the \"Gold on every minigame\" stretch objective of section 5.2."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fail_forward",
      "name_key": "achievement.fail_forward.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.fail_forward.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "mission_success",
          "op": "is_true"
        },
        {
          "metric": "retry_after_investigation",
          "op": "is_true"
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "The retry is the Retry option of section 9.9, after the investigation minigame MG-28."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "test_pilot",
      "name_key": "achievement.test_pilot.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.test_pilot.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "mission_success",
          "op": "is_true"
        }
      ],
      "assist_level": "flight_director"
    },
    {
      "id": "codex_collector",
      "name_key": "achievement.codex_collector.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.codex_collector.description",
      "scope": "career",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "codex_entries_unlocked",
          "op": "gte",
          "value": 100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "veto_visionary",
      "name_key": "achievement.veto_visionary.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.veto_visionary.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "vetoed_option_would_have_failed",
          "op": "is_true"
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "An individual award of 11.5 has the same name (data/awards.json); the two are separate kinds with separate IDs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ten_seats_full",
      "name_key": "achievement.ten_seats_full.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.ten_seats_full.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "mission_finished",
          "op": "is_true"
        },
        {
          "metric": "players_at_finish",
          "op": "gte",
          "value": 10
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "Ten is the largest player count (3.2); the design does not say whether all ten must still be connected at the end."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "blackout_calm",
      "name_key": "achievement.blackout_calm.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.blackout_calm.description",
      "scope": "mission",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "minigame_tier_gold",
          "op": "is_true",
          "minigame": "MG-25"
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "Platinum is Gold plus every player perfect, so it counts as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "patch_archivist",
      "name_key": "achievement.patch_archivist.name",
      "description_key": "achievement.patch_archivist.description",
      "scope": "career",
      "criteria": [
        {
          "metric": "mission_patches_designed",
          "op": "gte",
          "value": 10
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "value_types": {
    "achievements": "game_value"
  }
}
